{"unit_id":"ccclosed__dsh-selection-actions#card-zh","repo":"ccclosed/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"65e38804dcde75ea14804a41ee8424ad53d36306","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 是面向 DSH Web GUI 的对话引用插件。用户在对话内容中选中一段文字后，可通过浮动工具栏将片段作为引用加入当前会话草稿，或在并行聊天中继续追问。加入草稿的引用会序列化为带引用标记的 Markdown 区块；草稿上方显示引用数量，悬停可查看片段并移除本插件添加的引用。发送后的引用会在对话记录中呈现为引用卡片。并行聊天会尝试复制当前会话并打开右侧侧栏，无法使用时回退为同一工作区的新会话。插件逻辑运行在 Web 客户端，无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:944-991","client.js:647-659","client.js:670-698","client.js:1202-1204","client.js:1217-1229","client.js:1263-1289"]}
{"unit_id":"ccclosed__dsh-selection-actions#card-en","repo":"ccclosed/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"65e38804dcde75ea14804a41ee8424ad53d36306","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Selection Actions is a DSH Web plugin for quoting selected conversation text. Add an excerpt to the current draft or open a parallel chat. Quotes serialize as Markdown and render as transcript cards; the composer strip previews and removes citations. No extra configuration is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:944-991","client.js:647-659","client.js:670-698","client.js:1202-1204","client.js:1217-1229","client.js:1263-1289"]}
