{"unit_id":"ccclosed__dsh-selection-actions#feature-1","repo":"ccclosed/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"65e38804dcde75ea14804a41ee8424ad53d36306","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 的功能「当前聊天引用」：选中对话文本后，浮动工具栏提供“Add to chat”操作，把片段作为引用芯片加入当前会话草稿；发送时芯片会变成引用区块。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:944-991","client.js:647-638","client.js:1198-1204"]}
{"unit_id":"ccclosed__dsh-selection-actions#feature-2","repo":"ccclosed/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"65e38804dcde75ea14804a41ee8424ad53d36306","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 的功能「并行侧聊」：选择“Add in side chat”后，插件尝试 fork 当前 Session 并在右侧侧栏打开副本，再把同一引用放入新草稿；侧栏不可用时改为创建同工作区的新会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:670-698","client.js:701-715"]}
{"unit_id":"ccclosed__dsh-selection-actions#feature-3","repo":"ccclosed/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"65e38804dcde75ea14804a41ee8424ad53d36306","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 的功能「引用预览与清除」：草稿中的引用条显示引用数量，悬停或聚焦可预览各段内容；移除按钮清除插件添加的引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:724-900"]}
{"unit_id":"ccclosed__dsh-selection-actions#feature-4","repo":"ccclosed/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"65e38804dcde75ea14804a41ee8424ad53d36306","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 的功能「引用卡片展示」：发送后的引用区块会在对话记录中匹配并渲染为带摘录和来源标签的卡片。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1217-1249","client.js:1251-1261"]}
